challenges.description:
What is the difference between `schema.parse()` and `schema.safeParse()`?

  const result = ConfigSchema.safeParse(input)
  if (result.success) {
    const config = result.data  // typed as Config
  } else {
    console.error(result.error.issues)
  }

What does each composition method do?

  const Base = z.object({ id: z.string(), name: z.string() })

  const Extended = Base.extend({ port: z.number() })
  const Picked = Base.pick({ id: true })
  const Partial = Base.partial()
  const Merged = Base.merge(z.object({ port: z.number() }))
